y></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">서울- 광주(제주) 라인 데이터</span></b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100.124%; text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"7\">서울</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 41.5842%; text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"3\">실제 측정</td><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\">막대길이</td><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\">그림자길이</td><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\">각도(자동계산)</td><td style=\"width: 16.9554%; text-align: justify;\" rowspan=\"2\">수평자 사용 유무</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\">위도</td><td style=\"width: 11.5099%; text-align: justify;\">경도</td><td style=\"width: 16.2129%; text-align: justify;\">측정일시</td><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\">(cm)</td><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\">(cm)</td><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\">(도)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\" rowspan=\"2\">37.656398</td><td style=\"width: 11.1386%; text-align: justify;\" rowspan=\"2\">127.02729</td><td style=\"width: 16.5842%; text-align: justify;\" rowspan=\"2\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">2025.03.20.13:13</span></b></td><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\" rowspan=\"2\">45</td><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\" rowspan=\"2\">41.1</td><td style=\"width: 13.8614%; text-align: justify;\" rowspan=\"2\">42.406494</td><td style=\"width: 16.9554%; text-align: justify;\" rowspan=\"2\">O</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">다음 측정은</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">포항 라인은 4월 7일~13일&#160; 11시 17분~11시37분</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">부산 라인은 4월7일~13일 12시13분~12시33분</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">광주(제주) 라인은 4월7일~13일 13시52분~14시12분<br><br>입니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">함께 실험해봐요<br><br>학생들과 함께 하셔도 되고<br>선생님 혼자 시범 삼아 하셔도 됩니다<br><br>서울에 계시는 선생님들 함께 하셔도 됩니다<br></span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">자세한 실험 방법 및 내용은 아래 링크 글</span></b><br><b><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2</span></a></b></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=fLMH&amp;datanum=2\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;<br>댓글 남기시면<br>제가 시각을 맞추어 함께 실험 합니다.<br><br>댓글 안 다시고 실험만 하신다면<br>위 시간대에 실험하시면 됩니다.<br><br>실험하는 시간은 5분도 안 걸립니다<br>2분이면 되어서